2248	Individual successions are known as	Primary successions	Secondary successions	Seres	Xeroses	C	medium	Individual ecological successions are called seres.	Each specific successional sequence of a community, from pioneer to climax stages, is termed a 'sere,' distinguishing it from broader categories like primary/secondary succession.	'Sere' = one individual successional sequence; not to be confused with primary/secondary succession types.	2026-08-18 16:28:27.783607+05	t	2026-08-12 01:54:48.330566+05	2026-08-18 16:28:27.783927+05	12	126	t	f	\N	{"a": "Primary succession is a category/type of succession, not the term for an individual instance.", "b": "Secondary succession is also a category/type, not the term for an individual instance.", "c": "Correct — an individual succession is called a sere.", "d": "'Xeroses' is not the standard term for individual successions (xerosere refers to succession starting on dry land)."}
